        <mxCell id="ov_note" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" value="Notes:&#xa;- Two separate DB entry points exist: sql.Open(&quot;postgres&quot;,...) for goose migrations, and a&#xa;  pgxpool.Pool for all runtime queries (repositories) - two different drivers to the same DB.&#xa;- Click ingestion has two independent paths: synchronous (POST /api/v1/clicks -&gt; ClickRepository.Create)&#xa;  and asynchronous (GET /s/{alias} redirect -&gt; Queue.Push -&gt; batched -&gt; ClickRepository.BatchInsert)." vertex="1">
